# Keep text files LF in the repository and in every working tree. The build
# scripts, overlay init scripts and device-side helpers are executed by Linux
# (containers on the host, BusyBox on the handheld), where a CRLF shebang is a
# hard failure. eol=lf prevents Git for Windows from re-introducing CRLF on
# checkout, which is exactly what made a Windows clone unbuildable under WSL.
* text=auto eol=lf
